00:13:18.880 --> 00:13:22.800
tremendous potential and great friends

00:13:21.200 --> 00:13:25.760
of the United States. You're great

00:13:22.800 --> 00:13:28.320
friends. I mean, it's it's really so

00:13:25.760 --> 00:13:30.800
much better when you know people. I know

00:13:28.320 --> 00:13:32.720
almost all the people at the table and

00:13:30.800 --> 00:13:35.040
it just works so much easier, so much

00:13:32.720 --> 00:13:37.839
better. You know, the good ones, the bad

00:13:35.040 --> 00:13:39.519
ones, the bad ones, too, by the way. but

00:13:37.839 --> 00:13:41.040
you know the the people that you want to

00:13:39.519 --> 00:13:43.200
do business with and it's so much easier

00:13:41.040 --> 00:13:44.800
and it goes so fast. That's why we're

00:13:43.200 --> 00:13:46.800
able to do what we're doing right now

00:13:44.800 --> 00:13:49.279
and why your area is doing so well. I

00:13:46.800 --> 00:13:51.440
look forward to speaking with many of

00:13:49.279 --> 00:13:53.360
you tonight as we strengthen those bonds

00:13:51.440 --> 00:13:55.200
even further and work to build an

00:13:53.360 --> 00:13:59.120
incredible future for our people and for

00:13:55.200 --> 00:14:00.959
your people, the entire world actually.

00:13:59.120 --> 00:14:03.440
And President Marcos, I want to thank

00:14:00.959 --> 00:14:06.000
you very much. Your family is amazing.

00:14:03.440 --> 00:14:08.399
You're amazing. And I just met your son

00:14:06.000 --> 00:14:10.639
who's a beautiful young man. He's got a

00:14:08.399 --> 00:14:13.199
great future and it's an honor to meet

00:14:10.639 --> 00:14:14.560
you, especially to meet you. Okay?

00:14:13.199 --> 00:14:16.240
You've done a good job. Your parents

00:14:14.560 --> 00:14:17.600
have done a very good job. So, it's a

00:14:16.240 --> 00:14:20.720
great honor and thank you very much

00:14:17.600 --> 00:14:22.644
everybody. It's a real uh special group.

00:14:20.720 --> 00:14:24.664
Thank you.

00:14:22.644 --> 00:14:24.664
[applause]
